Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hffffff&}やっぱりかー
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.55,0:12:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hffffff&}すごい
