Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hffffff&}何これ？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hffffff&}めっちゃウケてる
